{"id":"b49c3b468ec36286","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-dontcarecover.md","title":"DNF minimization with dont-cares reduces to a prime-pattern cover","display":"thm-dontcarecover — DNF minimization with dont-cares reduces to a prime-pattern cover","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-dontcarecover","aliases":["27-thm-dontcarecover"],"display":"thm-dontcarecover — DNF minimization with dont-cares reduces to a prime-pattern cover","depends_on":["[[27-df-pattern]]","[[27-df-litset]]","[[27-df-extension]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.6 minimization with dont-cares","source_printed_pages":"559–560","source_pdf_pages":"583–584","verification_status":"source-cover-reduction-and-prime-expansion-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-dontcarecover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-dontcarecover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dontcarecover — DNF minimization with dont-cares reduces to a prime-pattern cover"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.6 minimization with dont-cares"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"559–560"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"583–584"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-cover-reduction-and-prime-expansion-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cap F=\\emptyset\">\\(T\\cap F=\\emptyset\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n,\\mathrm{PI}(T,F),\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n,\\mathrm{PI}(T,F),\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\mu\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(\\lambda,\\mu\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\lambda,\\mu}:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(C_{\\lambda,\\mu}:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{\\lambda,\\mu}(D)\\coloneqq\\lambda|D|+\\mu\\sum_{U\\in D}|\\mathrm{Lits}(U)|\\quad(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{\\lambda,\\mu}(D)\\coloneqq\\lambda|D|+\\mu\\sum_{U\\in D}|\\mathrm{Lits}(U)|\\quad(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min_{\\substack{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\\\ \\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)}}C_{\\lambda,\\mu}(D)\n=\n\\min_{D\\in\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}(T,F)}C_{\\lambda,\\mu}(D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min_{\\substack{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\\\ \\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)}}C_{\\lambda,\\mu}(D)\n=\n\\min_{D\\in\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}(T,F)}C_{\\lambda,\\mu}(D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\left(D\\in\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}(T,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\nD\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\\land\n\\forall a\\in T\\;\\exists U\\in D\\;(U(a)=1)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\left(D\\in\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}(T,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\nD\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\\land\n\\forall a\\in T\\;\\exists U\\in D\\;(U(a)=1)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §12.6，印刷 pp.559–560／PDF pp.583–584。书中分别取文字数和项数；本地非负线性组合涵盖两者。任意扩张DNF先删掉不覆盖T的项，再将每个剩余模式删除文字至prime pattern，覆盖T仍保持且避F，项数与文字总数均不增；去重也不增。有限一致项集保证终止及最小值存在。don’t-care点上的标签允许随所选覆盖变化，所以不是固定未知扩张的PI覆盖问题。T为空两边由空DNF取0。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pattern]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$、$T\\cap F=\\emptyset$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n,\\mathrm{PI}(T,F),\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。$\\lambda,\\mu\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；$C_{\\lambda,\\mu}:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$、$T\\cap F=\\emptyset$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n,\\mathrm{PI}(T,F),\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。$\\lambda,\\mu\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；$C_{\\lambda,\\mu}:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$、$T\\cap F=\\emptyset$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n,\\mathrm{PI}(T,F),\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。$\\lambda,\\mu\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；$C_{\\lambda,\\mu}:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"T\\cap F=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n,\\mathrm{PI}(T,F),\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lits}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda,\\mu\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\lambda,\\mu}:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\lambda,\\mu}(D)\\coloneqq\\lambda|D|+\\mu\\sum_{U\\in D}|\\mathrm{Lits}(U)|\\quad(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\min_{\\substack{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\\\ \\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)}}C_{\\lambda,\\mu}(D)\n=\n\\min_{D\\in\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}(T,F)}C_{\\lambda,\\mu}(D).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\left(D\\in\\mathrm{PrimeTheoryDNF}(T,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\nD\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\\land\n\\forall a\\in T\\;\\exists U\\in D\\;(U(a)=1)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2177,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-dontcarecover|thm-dontcarecover — DNF minimization with dont-cares reduces to a prime-pattern cover]]"}],"outgoing":["5b4178d75957ed66","8311e93eaac6c631","2080bf803b294b75"]}